     "prompt": "Use the second derivative to decide whether the curve $y=2x^3-9x^2+5$ is concave up or concave down at $x=1$.",
     "answer": {
      "short": "Concave down, since $y''(1)=-6<0$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}y'&=6x^2-18x\\\\y''&=12x-18\\\\y''(1)&=12-18=-6<0\\end{align*}$$ So the curve is concave down at $x=1$."
